[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4311140179","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118907#issuecomment-4311140179","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118907","id":4311140179,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAPbHUw","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-24T06:26:49Z","updated_at":"2026-04-24T06:26:49Z","body":"> I think adding a .tscn filter option (with default off) should help solve this and avoid tanking the search performance for most normal search use cases.\n\nResources also can have build-in scripts...\nSo, we should not use filter at all?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4311140179/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4311692778","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118907#issuecomment-4311692778","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118907","id":4311692778,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAP816g","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-24T08:18:09Z","updated_at":"2026-04-24T08:20:31Z","body":"Thank you for reporting, this is a limitation, see:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/9436\n\nNote that the [setting explains this](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_projectsettings.html#class-projectsettings-property-editor-script-search-in-file-extensions):\n> You can add e.g. `tscn` if you wish to also parse your scene files, especially if you use built-in scripts which are serialized in the scene files.\n\nClosing as a duplicate of the above proposal which would solve this more properly, see there for more context\n\nNote that adding the extension was always required, so no regression, it's just off by default for reasons explained in the proposal ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions